7D8B-C5EA-4B0F-B997-06C13EE82A70", "updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:19:22.228Z", "anchor": {"value": "call_ga0b1rortxygumz1qhguby9p", "type": "toolCall"}}, {"updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:18:15.543Z", "id": "59C4A1F5-10DF-4E58-B281-B13C83B18C6F", "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:18:11.343Z", "kind": "text", "text": "1. 调用 query_tasks_by_member 工具，查询当前主页成员未完成的任务，避免后续生成重复任务。\n2. 调用 fetch_sleep_details 工具，获取最近三天（2026-04-24 至 2026-04-26）的睡眠数据，用于睡眠质量分析。\n3. 调用 fetch_workout_details 工具，获取同时期的运动记录，了解运动情况。\n4. 调用 fetch_step_details 工具，获取同时期的步数数据，辅助评估活动量。\n5. 最后调用 generate_task 工具，基于收集到的健康数据生成健康任务。\n"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:18:18.655Z", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_lib32namz2gjydyqjgn5iptd"}, "id": "0FB38AF6-BAC4-47F9-8476-4F988D595E84", "toolName": "fetch_sleep_details", "toolCallID": "call_lib32namz2gjydyqjgn5iptd", "text": "正在使用工具：睡眠详情\n2026-04-25 睡眠时长 250 分钟（深睡 28 分钟，核心 153 分钟，REM 69 分钟，清醒 8 分钟）", "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:18:15.582Z", "kind": "tool"}, {"kind": "sleepVisualization", "updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:19:23.310Z", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_lib32namz2gjydyqjgn5iptd"}, "id": "3A9F02BB-9822-4E4E-80C4-DB9B83F08E84", "toolCallID": "call_lib32namz2gjydyqjgn5iptd", "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:19:22.228Z", "sleepVisualization": {"generatedAt": 1777339098, "days": [{"date": "2026-04-25", "timeline": [{"start": 1777145692, "end": 1777145843, "stage": "core", "endText": "03:37", "startText": "03:34", "startPercent": 0, "widthPercent": 0.9947954410698993}, {"start": 1777145843, "end": 1777145903, "stage": "awake", "endText": "03:38", "startText": "03:37", "startPercent": 0.9947954410698993, "widthPercent": 0.39528295671651625}, {"start": 1777145903, "end": 1777146806, "stage": "core", "endText": "03:53", "startText": "03:38", "startPercent": 1.3900783977864155, "widthPercent": 5.94900849858357}, {"start": 1777146806, "end": 1777146927, "stage": "deep", "endText": "03:55", "startText": "03:53", "startPercent": 7.339086896369985, "widthPercen