具：生成任务\n已根据描述生成 1 条待确认任务「步数/中等强度运动次数/深度睡眠时间」。请在消息内任务卡片中确认或忽略。", "toolName": "generate_task", "anchor": {"value": "call_g306e2mbqcy9ms31403awclb", "type": "toolCall"}, "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:56:39.511Z", "toolCallID": "call_g306e2mbqcy9ms31403awclb", "id": "532A3635-F51C-488A-A9B5-083403DAA95C", "updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:56:59.552Z", "kind": "tool"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:08.509Z", "id": "9D9E4ACB-9EE6-4151-850A-2C519F32A537", "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:05.804Z", "kind": "text", "text": "我来帮你执行健康分析任务。首先让我查询你最近三天的健康数据，然后根据数据为你生成健康任务。\n\n"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：运动详情\n运动记录 2026-04-24 - 2026-04-26:\n- 2026年4月26日 18:59: 羽毛球，时长 2小时3分钟，距离 2.21 公里，活动能量 897.9 千卡，平均心率 137 bpm", "toolName": "fetch_workout_details", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_l24ut7kbce5iwd5fwdxu4ecv"}, "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:08.601Z", "toolCallID": "call_l24ut7kbce5iwd5fwdxu4ecv", "id": "A5716E2B-23A1-4EF7-941D-70005146F210", "updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:11.190Z", "kind": "tool"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:55.264Z", "id": "CA867667-F1BA-4927-B13E-4279EB4FC70F", "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:20.334Z", "kind": "text", "text": "### 健康分析\n- **运动情况**：近三天（2026-04-24至2026-04-26）总步数24405步，日均约8135步；26日进行了2小时3分钟羽毛球运动，消耗897.9千卡，活动强度较好，但24、25日缺乏专门运动记录。\n- **睡眠情况**：仅25日有睡眠数据，时长250分钟（约4小时10分钟），深睡仅28分钟，睡眠时长和深睡占比均偏低。\n\n### 健康建议\n1. **运动频率**：每周保持3-5次类似羽毛球的中等强度运动，每次30分钟以上。\n2. **每日步数**：维持每日8000-10000步的步行目标。\n3. **睡眠改善**：固定作息时间，睡前避免电子设备，尝试冥想或轻音乐放松，延长睡眠时间并增加深睡占比。\n\n### 生成健康任务\n- 任务1：本周内再进行1次羽毛球或类似中等强度运动（如骑行、跑步），时长不少于30分钟。\n- 任务2：未来一周每日步行步数达到8000步以上。\n- 任务3：连续7天在23:00前入睡，保证每日睡眠时长不少于7小时。"}, {"kind": "taskCards", "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:55.384Z", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_g306e2mbqcy9ms31403awclb"}, "toolCallID": "call_g306e2mbqcy9ms31403awclb", "id": "99EB4B2E-9E83-49BA-8C78-B63032342A80", "updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:55.384Z", "taskCards": [{"status": 1, "business_type": "ai_task_generation", "priority": 1, "start_time": "2026-04-28T01:56:59.000Z", "id": -1777341419, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T01:58:14.000Z", "task_payload": {"task": "{\"creator_id\":\"current_user\",\"due_time\":\"2026-05-05T01:56:59.407Z\",\"member\":21,\"member_id\":21,\"priority\":1,\"repeat_type\":2,\"source\":1,\"start_time\":\"2026-04-28T01:56:59.407Z\",\"status\":0,\"type\":0}", "task_medical": "{\"description\":\"中等强度运动\\/步行\\/固定作息\\/睡前放松\",\"medical_task_type\":\"步数\\/中等强度运动次数\\/深度睡眠时间\",\"reminder_time\":\"2026-04-28T01:56:59Z\"}"}, "type": 0, "member": 21, "due_time": "2026-05-05T01:56:59.000Z", "ignored_reason": "", "description": "目标：步数/中等强度运动次数/深度睡眠时间\n动作：中等强度运动/步行/固定作息/睡前放松\n计划：每周3-5次/每天1次\n强度：类似羽毛球/8000-10000步", "source": 1, "created_at": "2026-04-28T01:56:59.000Z", "similarity_payload": {"similar_count": "0", "member_source": "thread_member_binding", "queried_first": "true"}, "repeat_type": 2, "extract_payload": {"start_time": "", "confidence": "0.90", "period": "weekly/daily", "frequency": "每周3-5次/每天1次", "target_metric": "步数/中等强度运动次数/深度睡眠时间", "action": "中等强度运动/步行/固定作息/睡前放松", "task_type": "exercise|medical", "intensity_or_value": "类似羽毛球/8000-10000步"}, "business_id": "", "title": "步数/中等强度运动次数/深度睡眠时间"}]}, {"kind": "taskCards", "createdAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:55.384Z", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_g306e2mbqcy9ms31403awclb"}, "toolCallID": "call_g306e2mbqcy9ms31403awclb", "id": "4CD46EC6-A689-4ED9-BE5D-7E182D507D45", "updatedAt": "2026-04-28T01:57:55.384Z", "taskCards": [{"status": 1, "business_type": "ai_task_generation", "priority": 1, "start_time": "2026-04-28T01:56:59.000Z", "id": -1777341419, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T01:58:14.000Z", "task_payload": {"task_medical": "{\"description\":\"中等强度运动\\/步行\\/固定作息\\/睡前放松\",\"medical_task_type\":\"步数\\/中等强度运动次数\\/深度睡眠时间\",\"reminder_time\":\"2026-04-28T01:56:59Z\"}", "task": "{\"creator_id\":\"current_user\",\"due_time\":\"2026-05-05T01:56:59.407Z\",\"member\":21,\"member_id\":21,\"priority\":1,\"repeat_type\":2,\"source\":1,\"start_time\":\"2026-04-28T01:56:59.407Z\",\"status\":0,\"type\":0}"}, "type": 0, "member": 21, "due_time": "2026-05-05T01:56:59.000Z", "ignored_reason": "", "description": "目标：步数/中等强度运动次数/深度睡眠时间\n动作：中等强度运动/步行/固定作息/睡前放松\n计划：每周3-5次/每天1次\n强度：类似羽毛球/8000-10000步", "source": 1, "created_at": "2026-04-28T01:56:59.000Z", "similarity_payload": {"member_source": "thread_member_binding", "similar_count": "0", "queried_first": "true"}, "repeat_type": 2, "extract_payload": {"frequency": "每周3-5次/每天1次", "action": "中等强度运动/步行/固定作息/睡前放松", "target_metric": "步数/中等强度运动次数/深度睡眠时间", "period": "weekly/daily", "start_time": "", "confidence": "0.90", "task_type": "exercise|medical", "intensity_or_value": "类似羽毛球/8000-10000步"}, "business_id": "", "title": "步数/中等强度运动次数/深度睡眠时间"}]}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}]}}
